  "title": "Demo Reel: how a narrated MP4 gets built",
  "summary": "One `demo-reel build` run, drawn as the system it touches. The CLI loads demo-reel.yaml, turns narration.txt into an MP3, measures it, boots your app, opens /demo in headless Chromium and screenshots one frame per seek(t), then encodes and muxes with ffmpeg. Nothing here changes: this is the map of the pipeline, drawn with PR Lens so a pull request against it can be read against the same picture.",
